# The stock QTI Gatekeeper service is assigned to early_hal, a class that is
# not started by the AOSP init sequence.  Start it explicitly alongside the
# QTI KeyMint and Keymaster services so gatekeeperd is available before
# BiometricService is constructed.
on init
    start gatekeeper-1-0
